                "3f037ea7-af35-8154-a838-c783f4296b85"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Business: Excellent — 92/100. Moat full-stack exceptionnel; croissance et marges fortes; tail risk de financement/capacité en hausse.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8141-8d31-d82ad4aa27c5",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8141-8d31-d82ad4aa27c5"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 2,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Rapport complet",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8173-b5ca-f808986420b1",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8173-b5ca-f808986420b1"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Business Check — NVIDIA",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-812d-a26e-cffed451ef10",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-812d-a26e-cffed451ef10"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Run ID: NVDA-FA-20261005-WRITE-PROOF-2. Date: 2026-10-05. Ticker: NVDA. Exchange: NASDAQ. Currency: USD. Business score 92/100 [E:B1]. Confiance: High. Persistance: NOT_REQUIRED.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8186-b60c-ff5c4ba5b24a",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8186-b60c-ff5c4ba5b24a"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "TL;DR",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-813f-9e8d-c2cf3d25a59a",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-813f-9e8d-c2cf3d25a59a"
              ],
              "type": "callout",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Verdict: Excellent — 92/100 [E:B1]. NVIDIA conserve un moat full-stack exceptionnel; la croissance et les marges restent hors norme. Le rôle croissant de facilitateur financier et l’ampleur des engagements ajoutent un tail risk corrélé, sans invalider le business central.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ],
              "icon": "💡"
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81a3-906b-ff94c0a8553d",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81a3-906b-ff94c0a8553d",
                "3f037ea7-af35-818b-b28f-db0f783ab2c4"
              ],
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Forces: moat système CUDA + accélérateurs + networking; economics et génération de cash; cadence Blackwell/Rubin.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Risques: concentration du capex IA; réponse d’offre/capacité; financement et contreparties de l’écosystème.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8164-a9d5-ed1725c69af8",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8164-a9d5-ed1725c69af8"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "1. Schéma du business",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-813c-84a0-c7de0744e0d3",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-813c-84a0-c7de0744e0d3"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Chaîne économique: fournisseurs foundry/packaging/HBM → NVIDIA → OEM/ODM/CSP/AI cloud → utilisateurs finaux. NVIDIA élargit la captation de valeur du GPU vers rack-scale, networking, CPU/interconnect et software.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81b1-a5f2-cdc31d4c41c5",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81b1-a5f2-cdc31d4c41c5"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "2. Business model",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8183-aa60-eb3428bd65f6",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8183-aa60-eb3428bd65f6"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Au Q2 FY2027, le Data Center représente environ 89 Md$ de revenu sur 96,2 Md$ consolidés [E:B2][E:B3], soit ~92,5% [D:B1]. Le business reste majoritairement transactionnel en hardware, avec une répétition économique élevée mais non contractuellement garantie.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81f9-b6c7-f74c41420ace",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81f9-b6c7-f74c41420ace"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "La concentration clients est matérielle: cinq clients directs représentent 22%, 14%, 13%, 11% et 10% des créances au 26 juillet 2026 [E:B8].",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81bc-bb01-fe7888fa495a",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81bc-bb01-fe7888fa495a"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "3. Marché et structure",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8150-9db8-ecf16dfda8c5",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8150-9db8-ecf16dfda8c5"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Le marché adressé exact TAM/SAM/SOM n’est pas prouvé de façon suffisamment homogène dans ce run. GAP: aucune estimation externe unique n’est retenue comme fait. Le signal structurel observable reste la croissance Data Center de NVIDIA à 117% y/y au Q2 FY2027 [E:B3].",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8101-b2e2-ed197f646511",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8101-b2e2-ed197f646511"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "4. Produits",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8133-9650-dce7ec209583",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8133-9650-dce7ec209583"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Blackwell/Blackwell Ultra restent le cœur de la génération actuelle; Vera Rubin constitue la prochaine étape de roadmap. Le caractère exact du calendrier commercial par sous-produit n’est pas reconstruit ici sans locator additionnel; la roadmap reste un élément qualitatif.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-811d-a6f1-d3a1199cdb7c",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-811d-a6f1-d3a1199cdb7c"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "5. Concurrence et moat",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81c7-b2a5-eb35c93ae28e",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81c7-b2a5-eb35c93ae28e"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Le moat vient du co-design hardware/software/networking et des coûts de switching liés à CUDA. Les concurrents pertinents incluent AMD et les accélérateurs propriétaires des hyperscalers. L’écart de taille reste très important: NVIDIA Data Center a généré 89 Md$ au Q2 FY2027 [E:B3].",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81c4-9629-d80ad083b375",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81c4-9629-d80ad083b375"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "6. Qualité financière",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81c2-a491-d31e64df739c",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81c2-a491-d31e64df739c"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Le H1 FY2027 affiche 74,421 Md$ de CFO [E:B5]. Les créances sont 63,059 Md$ et les stocks 31,575 Md$ [E:B6][E:B7], ce qui impose une surveillance accrue de la conversion cash.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-812a-9ea5-d7da2e0db2fa",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-812a-9ea5-d7da2e0db2fa"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "7. Management",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81e2-acce-f9bbcfa1744a",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81e2-acce-f9bbcfa1744a"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "L’exécution produit et industrielle sous Jensen Huang reste un point fort. La principale réserve de gouvernance économique n’est pas l’allocation historique mais l’expansion des mécanismes de soutien/financement à l’écosystème, qui augmente la corrélation au cycle.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8194-8415-e2ddbbf511bb",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8194-8415-e2ddbbf511bb"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "8. Croissance 5–10 ans",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81d0-8181-ca6f47aa2638",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81d0-8181-ca6f47aa2638",
                "3f037ea7-af35-8136-9075-d52e611059a6",
                "3f037ea7-af35-81f2-9d84-e1dabbe29969",
                "3f037ea7-af35-8120-8a61-f6d473e4003f"
              ],
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Training: moteur confirmé.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Inference: moteur probable à confirmé.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Networking/systèmes complets: moteur confirmé.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Sovereign/physical AI: moteurs potentiels; contribution exacte non prouvée dans ce run.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8115-81ff-f6e078253c21",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8115-81ff-f6e078253c21"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "9. Risques / bear industriel",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8189-8875-c0b085c34ea2",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8189-8875-c0b085c34ea2"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "10. Peers",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-819a-8de6-eab707707d78",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-819a-8de6-eab707707d78"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "La comparaison peer est limitée par l’hétérogénéité des modèles. AMD reste le challenger marchand principal; les ASIC hyperscalers constituent une concurrence verticale. Aucun multiple peer homogène n’est utilisé pour scorer Business.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8171-8e4d-c51ff74d8dd6",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8171-8e4d-c51ff74d8dd6"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "11. Score",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8187-a8ff-e45a581146b8",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8187-a8ff-e45a581146b8"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "12. Prochains résultats",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-811a-bd26-e437859ead55",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-811a-bd26-e437859ead55"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "Guide Q3: revenu 108 Md$ ±2% et marge brute autour de 74% [E:B9]. Ce sont des déclarations de management, pas des résultats réalisés.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81da-ba94-feb5eebf8607",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81da-ba94-feb5eebf8607"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "13. Questions ouvertes",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-816f-9f5d-ea37f80a45d2",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-816f-9f5d-ea37f80a45d2",
                "3f037ea7-af35-810f-9593-f1dc31d37074",
                "3f037ea7-af35-816a-8c33-c006f9b4c760",
                "3f037ea7-af35-813e-a15c-e1a008a58730"
              ],
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Utilisation économique des clusters ajoutés.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Rental yields et residual values.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Part de demande marginale soutenue par financement/backstops.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Part capturable du TAM face au custom silicon.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81e8-b982-c95f5d11cd78",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81e8-b982-c95f5d11cd78"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "14. Takeaways",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8150-97c0-e21c2339a788",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8150-97c0-e21c2339a788",
                "3f037ea7-af35-819b-8817-e17ab891b342",
                "3f037ea7-af35-8184-9603-c5ce6c4bf0b7"
              ],
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Le business reste Excellent 92/100 [E:B1].",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Les résultats Q2 FY2027 confirment une croissance et des marges exceptionnelles [E:B2][E:B3].",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "text": "Le principal changement de risque concerne BFR, engagements et réflexivité, pas le moat central.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "href": null
                  }
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81d8-8ec1-e28a81885640",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81d8-8ec1-e28a81885640"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "15. Conclusion finale",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-815c-88dd-d9707e6eef82",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-815c-88dd-d9707e6eef82"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "NVIDIA mérite une valorisation premium en raison de son moat système, de son economics et de sa cadence produit. La qualité business reste excellente; la résilience est la composante la plus faible en raison de la concentration et du risque de cycle.",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-812e-a1e7-d2f110dd34e2",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-812e-a1e7-d2f110dd34e2"
              ],
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 1,
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "16. Sources",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-81c2-8b52-e0d732b0fec8",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-81c2-8b52-e0d732b0fec8"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "NVIDIA Q2 FY2027 results — période Q2 FY2027; consulté pendant le run; locator: Revenue / Data Center / gross margin / Q3 outlook — ",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                },
                {
                  "text": "https://investor.nvidia.com/news/press-release-details/2026/NVIDIA-Announces-Financial-Results-for-Second-Quarter-Fiscal-2027/",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": "https://investor.nvidia.com/news/press-release-details/2026/NVIDIA-Announces-Financial-Results-for-Second-Quarter-Fiscal-2027/"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3f037ea7-af35-8140-b2df-e92cce057f57",
              "sourceIds": [
                "3f037ea7-af35-8140-b2df-e92cce057f57"
              ],
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": [
                {
                  "text": "NVIDIA Q2 FY2027 10-Q — période close 2026-07-26; locator: balance sheet, cash flows, customer concentration, payment terms — ",
                  "marks": [],
                  "href": null
                },
                {
